<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Text2Mem: A Unified Memory Operation Language for Memory Operating System</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Felix Wang
</span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
